Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 15 \N {\fs100} New Year {正月の巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.09,0:00:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a New Year here in Hermit Village. {正月 is especifically the start of a new year and in English "New Year" is only capitalized when it refers to the holiday of New Year's Eve and New Year's Day, so technically you could have it lowercase but that would make you look even more of an ESL (paradoxically) so I won't change it, just reword it so it's clear it's not New Year's Day but the start of a new year}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.71,0:01:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on... No!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.43,0:01:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.69,0:01:45.86,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.03,0:01:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,New Years! {"omedetou" as shorthand for "akemashiteomedetou" not literally as "congratulations" you ESL prick}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.09,0:01:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've arrived at just the right time.\NThe theater performance is about to begin.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.28,0:02:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going... {????? guess}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.50,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.29,0:02:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.71,0:02:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Plain Woman. {homely woman (esp. one with a small low nose, high flat forehead, and bulging cheeks); plain woman - the role in those traditional dances, same as in cat-eyed boy}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.27,0:02:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.73,0:02:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you fool around with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.36,0:02:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is bad...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.47,0:02:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.94,0:02:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.40,0:02:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.48,0:02:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.33,0:02:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.58,0:02:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.23,0:02:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.21,0:03:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.40,0:03:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.51,0:03:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Husband! Is that how you make plans \Nfor the whole year, huh?! Oh, you're the worst! {一年の計は元旦にあり means "the whole year's plans should be made on New Year's Day​" so it's a variation of that ig}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.11,0:03:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll think twice before marrying. {?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.21,0:03:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's your New Year's resolution, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.99,0:03:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,After thinking it over, \NI've decided to stop cheating this year.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.45,0:03:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The absolute rake! {lit: cheating bug}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.29,0:03:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,"I've decided to stop cheating!"
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.82,0:03:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.62,0:03:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's make a bet. If he cheats in the next five days, I'll give you my incense box. {???????????} {香箱}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.08,0:03:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll bet he lasts more than five days.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.15,0:03:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll owe me a dinner \Nif he lasts longer than that.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.38,0:04:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Elder, \Nwhat was your New Year's resolution?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.27,0:04:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,About that... {??????? maybe "it was that"}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.30,0:04:20.08,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Can he really give up \Non the drinking that he loves so much?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.83,0:04:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but the hors-d'oeuvre was sake. It's 8% alcohol. {?????????????????????????????? no clue what's it to do with father} {think it's お通し -> appetizer; idk tho too hungover for that}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.93,0:04:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first well water of this year. {first water drawn from a well on New Year's Day}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.52,0:04:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.61,0:04:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I say...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.69,0:04:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.28,0:04:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give up on gambling.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.59,0:04:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Horse racing, cards, mahjong, poker, dice... {actually hanafuda but idk how to differentiate it from normal cards (he calls trump)}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.98,0:05:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't touch... Won't touch any of it...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.52,0:05:05.23,Song,,0,0,0,,Giving up on gambling, giving up on betting...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.23,0:05:06.18,Song,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.18,0:05:09.77,Song,,0,0,0,,But without betting, there can be no women or drinks.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.77,0:05:10.42,Song,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.42,0:05:17.17,Song,,0,0,0,,And if you ever lapse this year, \Nyou'll fall straight into hell... {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.81,0:05:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if {\i1}he{\i0} will last five days.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.28,0:05:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly not. {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If he pulls that off, \Nhe'll be the next headman. {?????????????}{no clue either}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.13,0:06:00.60,Song,,0,0,0,,Let us go hunt for flowers \Nthat ooze the smell of spring. {doesn't seem to be a real song, the lyrics sound like 春の香りする花を見つけよう}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.60,0:06:10.56,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's search for the sweet nectar \Nthat stirs our hearts.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.56,0:06:24.44,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's find the flowers that ooze the scent of spring \Nquickly before they fall. {the song is not bad tbh lol}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.54,0:06:29.19,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And so, five days thus passed.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.19,0:06:31.61,Narrator,,0,0,0,,What of the three oaths?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.97,0:06:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Alcohol is a temptation.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.60,0:06:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Alcohol is an evil magician.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.81,0:06:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.86,0:06:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell to my cherished brother-in-arms who's been beside me so long. {??????????????????????????????? not a word}{戦敷く呟かに愛玩せし銘記おさらば - poetic}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.53,0:07:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this means I'll have to find \Nsomething else to kill time with. {????????}{"now it's all really over" kind of line}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.95,0:07:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.50,0:07:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but whatever shall I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.68,0:07:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything I could do?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.02,0:07:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Can't let it go to waste!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.25,0:07:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh... I ended up doing it, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.75,0:07:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm through with it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.26,0:08:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.98,0:08:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what the almighty God taught us.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.25,0:08:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't succumb to the temptation.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.78,0:08:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you listen to what the God Eros taught us...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.21,0:08:35.17,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Goodness! Did you forget \Nyour vow already, Senior Apprentice?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.01,0:08:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No good...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.73,0:08:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm vulnerable to seduction, weak in the face of women—it's just basic humanism.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.40,0:08:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.90,0:09:03.94,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Junior Disciple's mind just kept going in circles—without gambling, his heart was empty. {??????????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.94,0:09:06.28,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Echo, echo, echo...{onomatopoea for something being empty, dunno what to put in here}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.37,0:09:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's not having it easy either.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.04,0:09:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't force yourself. \NIt's all for naught in the end. {??????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.72,0:09:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all! How can I let myself be defeated?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.06,0:09:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just an empty struggle, can't you see? {?????????? lit: it's no good when it's only sounds of emptiness}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.21,0:09:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not for naught!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.55,0:09:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.99,0:09:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna bet on it? {lit: how much do you bet}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.35,0:09:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.98,0:09:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shucks...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.91,0:09:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.52,0:09:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what of your vow?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.08,0:09:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not one to break my vow \Nwhen not even five days have passed. {?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.28,0:09:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Ah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.76,0:09:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, people!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.07,0:10:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.36,0:10:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.53,0:10:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Elder gave in as well?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.72,0:10:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so unreliable.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.71,0:10:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Junior Disciple gave in as well. \NThat means you won{あんたの勝ち}! {??????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.72,0:10:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you looking this happy?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.31,0:10:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, back then, I overheard you two...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.61,0:10:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who offered that bet.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I really thought better of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.78,0:10:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you saying? {????????}{何のこっちゃい}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.02,0:10:58.59,Narrator,,0,0,0,,In the end, everyone broke their New Year's resolution five days in.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.54,0:11:05.57,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But don't you think that you shouldn't make vows \Nyou wouldn't be able to uphold, everyone? {?????????}
